return ['domain'=>'zinn-connector','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'zh_CN','project-id-version'=>'zinn-connector','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-08T21:12:05+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-08T21:12:05+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Connector'=>'Zinn® Connector','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-connector'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-connector','Connects this WordPress site to Zinn Digital® so scheduled articles can be published to it. Paste a pairing code from your Zinn® dashboard and the plugin sets up its own credential — nothing is copied by hand.'=>'将此 WordPress 网站连接至 Zinn Digital®，以便将计划发布的文章发布到该网站。从您的 Zinn® 仪表板粘贴配对码，插件即可自行设置凭据——无需手动复制。','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'已存储。请输入新值进行替换。','Filter this list…'=>'筛选此列表…','Filter this list'=>'筛选此列表','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'没有符合该筛选条件的内容。','Add a row'=>'添加行','Remove this row'=>'删除此行','Remove'=>'删除','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — 概览','Overview'=>'概览','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'此网站上的每个 Zinn® 插件及其运行状态。','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'此插件不需要连接网络。','Open settings'=>'打开设置','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'您没有权限更改这些设置。','Settings sections'=>'设置部分','Support'=>'支持','Save changes'=>'保存更改','Tools'=>'工具','Export settings'=>'导出设置','Reset to defaults'=>'恢复默认设置','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'这会将此插件的各项设置全部恢复为默认值。是否继续？','Diagnostics for support'=>'技术支持诊断','Import a settings file'=>'导入设置文件','Import'=>'导入','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'导出的文件中绝不包含密码、令牌或 API 密钥——您需要在新网站上重新输入这些信息。','Settings saved.'=>'设置已保存。','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'此插件的所有设置均已恢复为默认值。','Done.'=>'完成。','That action is not available.'=>'该操作不可用。','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'无法读取该文件。请选择从 Zinn® 插件导出的设置文件。','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'该文件太大，无法作为设置导出。','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'该文件不是 Zinn® 设置导出文件。','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'该文件是从另一个插件 (%s) 导出的，因此在这里导入它将存储该插件无法识别的设置。','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'已导入 %d 个设置。密码和 API 密钥不会包含在导出文件中，请重新输入。','The archive would be %1$d MB, over the %2$d MB limit set on this site. Raise the limit, or exclude some folders, on the Zinn Digital® → Connector → Backups screen.'=>'存档大小将为 %1$d MB，超出了本网站设定的 %2$d MB 限制。请在 Zinn Digital® → Connector → Backups 屏幕上提高限制，或排除某些文件夹。','This site\'s PHP cannot create archives, so a backup could not be made.'=>'此网站的 PHP 无法创建归档，因此无法进行备份。','Could not create a temporary file.'=>'无法创建临时文件。','This site\'s files could not be archived.'=>'无法将此网站的文件存档。','This site\'s PHP cannot compress archives, so a backup could not be made.'=>'此网站的 PHP 无法压缩归档文件，因此无法进行备份。','A backup of this site needs about %1$s of temporary space and only %2$s is free, so it was not attempted.'=>'此网站的备份大约需要 %1$s 的临时空间，但目前仅有 %2$s 可用，因此未尝试进行备份。','This WordPress user cannot publish posts, so a connection made now could not publish either. Sign in as a user who can, and try again.'=>'此 WordPress 用户无法发布文章，因此现在建立的连接也无法发布文章。请以具有发布权限的用户身份登录，然后重试。','Application passwords are turned off on this site, so we cannot create a credential. Ask your host to enable them, or connect the site with a password you create yourself in your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'本网站已禁用应用程序密码，因此我们无法创建凭据。请联系您的主机提供商启用该功能，或使用您自己在 Zinn Digital® 控制面板中创建的密码连接网站。','WordPress would not create a credential for this site. Nothing has been sent anywhere.'=>'WordPress 无法为此网站创建凭据。没有任何内容被发送到任何地方。','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this site. Nothing was connected, and the credential we made has been removed. Check the site can make outgoing requests, and try again.'=>'无法从该网站连接到 Zinn Digital®。未连接任何内容，且我们创建的凭据已被删除。请检查该网站是否可以发送出站请求，然后重试。','Zinn Digital® did not accept that pairing code. Nothing was connected. Generate a fresh code in your dashboard and try again.'=>'Zinn Digital® 未接受该配对码。未连接任何内容。请在您的控制面板中生成新代码并重试。','Connected. Zinn Digital® can now publish to this site.'=>'已连接。Zinn Digital® 现在可以发布到此网站。','Connected'=>'已连接','Connecting…'=>'正在连接…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'已连接，但有些问题需要处理','Not connected'=>'未连接','Running on your own account'=>'在您自己的账户上运行','We could not check this'=>'无法检查此项','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'此插件未说明原因。请发送诊断报告，我们将进行查看。','Connection status'=>'连接状态','Last checked %s ago.'=>'上次检查于 %s 前。','(opens in a new tab)'=>'（在新标签页中打开）','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'发送至 Zinn® 支持','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'这正是将要发送的内容——没有别的，也没有隐藏内容。您的密码、令牌和 API 密钥均不包含在其中。','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'即将发送的诊断报告','Copy to clipboard'=>'复制到剪贴板','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'将此报告发送给 Zinn® 支持部门','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'我们为您创建一个支持工单并通过电子邮件回复。如果您不想发送，请将其复制并在工单中自行粘贴。','Copied'=>'已复制','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'无法从该服务器 (%s) 连接到 Zinn Digital®。请复制上方的报告并提交工单 —— 您的设置没有任何错误。','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'Zinn® 客服已收到您的报告，并将通过电子邮件回复。','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'已收到您的反馈 — 编号 %s — Zinn® 支持团队将通过电子邮件回复。','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'您在短时间内发送了多个报告。请稍候几分钟再试——先前的报告已经送达。','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® 刚才无法接受该报告——这是我们这边的问题，不是您的。请稍后重试，或将上面的报告复制到工单中。','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'报告遭拒绝（HTTP %d）。请将其复制到上方并提交工单，同时附上该编号。','This site’s owner has turned off image uploads for Zinn Digital® in the Zinn® Connector settings.'=>'此网站的所有者已在 Zinn® Connector 设置中为 Zinn Digital® 关闭了图片上传功能。','This site’s owner has turned off edits to existing articles for Zinn Digital® in the Zinn® Connector settings.'=>'此网站的所有者已在 Zinn® Connector 设置中关闭了对 Zinn Digital® 现有文章的编辑功能。','New article on your site: %s'=>'您网站上的新文章：%s','Zinn Digital® has added an article to your site.

Title: %1$s
Edit it: %2$s
Status: %3$s

Turn these emails off on the Zinn Digital® → Connector → Publishing screen.'=>'Zinn Digital® 已向您的网站添加了一篇文章。

