状态：%3$s

您可以在 Zinn Digital® → Connector → Publishing 屏幕上关闭这些电子邮件。','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — 指南与服务','User guides'=>'用户指南','Read the %s user guide'=>'阅读%s用户指南','Hide this'=>'隐藏此项','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Zinn® WordPress 托管','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed、每日备份、免费迁移以及为管理多个网站的人群打造的控制面板。','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Zinn® 市场','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'买卖成熟的网站、域名和外链，资金安全托管，直到双方满意为止。','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — 聘请以此为生的人','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'我们的全球自由职业者市场：浏览来自作家、设计师、开发人员和 SEO 专家的 10,000 多项现成服务，或者发布项目并让他们竞标。','Connector'=>'连接器','Connection'=>'连接','Publishing'=>'正在发布','Backups'=>'备份','Advanced'=>'高级','Check the connection now'=>'立即检查连接','Disconnect this site'=>'断开此站点连接','This revokes the credential Zinn Digital® uses, so we can no longer publish to this site. Anything already published stays. Continue?'=>'这将撤销 Zinn Digital® 使用的凭据，因此我们将无法再发布到此网站。已发布的内容将保留。是否继续？','What we may do on this site'=>'我们可能在本网站上进行的操作','The credential we hold is an ordinary WordPress application password, so WordPress itself decides what is possible. These narrow it further, on your side.'=>'我们持有的凭据是普通的 WordPress 应用密码，因此由 WordPress 自身决定哪些操作是可行的。这些选项会在您这一端作进一步限制。','Publish articles as'=>'发布文章为','Choose “a draft” if you would rather read everything before it goes live.'=>'如果想在所有内容正式发布前先审阅一遍，请选择“草稿”。','Published straight away'=>'立即发布','A draft, for me to review'=>'草稿，留待我审阅','Pending review'=>'等待审核','Scheduled, using the date we send'=>'按我们发送的日期安排','Show the author as'=>'显示作者为','Which of your users appears as the author. This does not change who we sign in as.'=>'哪个用户显示为作者。这不会更改我们登录时使用的身份。','Put articles in'=>'将文章放入','Allow images'=>'允许图片','Let Zinn Digital® upload images into this site’s media library'=>'允许 Zinn Digital® 将图片上传到此网站的媒体库中','Turn this off and articles arrive without their images. Nothing already uploaded is removed.'=>'关闭此功能后，文章在送达时将不包含图片。已上传的内容不会被删除。','Allow edits'=>'允许编辑','Let Zinn Digital® update an article it published before'=>'让 Zinn Digital® 更新其之前发布的文章','Used for corrections and re-optimisation. It never touches anything you wrote yourself.'=>'用于修正和重新优化。它绝不会触及您自己写的任何内容。','Tell me when something is published'=>'请在发布新内容时通知我','Leave blank for no email. One message per article, from your own site.'=>'留空则不发送邮件。每篇文章发送一条消息，来自您自己的网站。','Off-site backups'=>'异地备份','This site sends its own backup straight to Zinn® storage. Nothing passes through our servers on the way.'=>'此站点会将自身的备份直接发送至 Zinn® 存储。途中没有任何数据经过我们的服务器。','Back this site up to Zinn Digital®'=>'将此网站备份至 Zinn Digital®','Backup token'=>'备份令牌','Set for you when the site was connected. You will only need to touch this if support asks.'=>'在网站连接时为您设置。除非客服人员要求，否则无需修改。','Leave these out'=>'排除这些','One path per line, relative to wp-content — for example <code>cache</code> or <code>uploads/backups</code>. Caches and other backup plugins’ folders are the usual candidates.'=>'每行一个路径，相对于 wp-content —— 例如 <code>cache</code> 或 <code>uploads/backups</code>。缓存以及其他备份插件的文件夹通常是常见选项。','Stop if the archive would exceed'=>'如果归档文件超出大小限制则停止','Megabytes. A shared host will usually kill a very large archive part-way; a bound turns that into a message instead of a silent failure.'=>'兆字节。共享主机通常会在中途终止非常大的归档文件；而限制则会将其转化为一条消息，而不是静默失败。','Detailed logging'=>'详细日志','Record what this plugin does, for support'=>'记录此插件的功能以便于支持','Kept on this site, capped at the last 50 entries, and included in a diagnostics report. Turn it on before reproducing a problem.'=>'保留在本网站上，最多保存最近 50 条记录，并包含在诊断报告中。请在复现问题之前将其开启。','On uninstall'=>'卸载时','Delete this plugin’s settings when it is uninstalled'=>'卸载此插件时删除其设置','Uninstalling never revokes the application password — that is deliberate, so uninstalling to try something else does not break your publishing. Use Disconnect above if you want the credential gone.'=>'卸载绝不会撤销应用程序密码——这是刻意设计的，因此卸载以尝试其他内容不会破坏您的发布。如果您希望凭据消失，请使用上方的“断开连接”。','The user we sign in as'=>'我们登录时所使用的用户','The site’s default category'=>'站点默认分类','Connect this site again'=>'重新连接此站点','Connect this site'=>'连接此站点','Open your Zinn Digital® dashboard, go to Content → Other sites, and press “Get a pairing code”. Paste it below.'=>'打开您的 Zinn Digital® 仪表板，前往“内容”→“其他站点”，然后点击“获取配对码”。将其粘贴到下方。','Connecting again creates a fresh credential and leaves the old one in place — use Disconnect first if you want the old one gone.'=>'重新连接会创建一个新的凭据并保留旧凭据——如果要删除旧凭据，请先使用断开连接。','Pairing code'=>'配对码','It expires thirty minutes after you generate it, and can only be used once.'=>'它会在您生成后的三十分钟内过期，且只能使用一次。','You are not allowed to connect this site.'=>'您无权连接此网站。','This site is not connected to Zinn Digital®.'=>'本网站与 Zinn Digital® 无关。','Nothing is wrong — it has simply not been paired yet. Get a pairing code from your Zinn® dashboard and paste it below.'=>'没有问题——只是尚未配对。请从您的 Zinn® 仪表板获取配对码并将其粘贴在下方。','Open my Zinn® dashboard'=>'打开我的 Zinn® 仪表板','The connection is broken.'=>'连接已中断。','The WordPress user the credential belonged to (%s) no longer exists on this site, so nothing we send can be published. Connect again as a user who can publish.'=>'此凭据所属的 WordPress 用户 (%s) 已不在此站点上，因此我们发送的内容无法发布。请以具有发布权限的用户身份重新连接。','The “Zinn Digital® (publishing)” application password has been deleted from this site, so we can no longer sign in. Connect again to create a new one — nothing else was lost.'=>'“Zinn Digital® (publishing)”应用程序密码已从此网站删除，因此我们无法再登录。请重新连接以创建一个新密码 — 没有丢失其他任何内容。','See this site’s application passwords'=>'查看此网站的应用密码','Connected, but publishing would fail.'=>'已连接，但发布将会失败。','The credential belongs to %s, and that user can no longer publish posts. Sign-in still works, so nothing looks wrong until an article is due. Give that user the ability to publish, or connect again as somebody who can.'=>'此凭据属于 %s，该用户已无法发布文章。登录功能仍然正常，因此在需要发布文章之前，表面上一切正常。请授予该用户发布权限，或使用具备发布权限的用户重新连接。','Edit that user'=>'编辑该用户','Connected here — we could not reach Zinn Digital® to confirm.'=>'已在此连接 — 无法联系到 Zinn Digital® 进行确认。','Connected, but your Zinn® account needs attention.'=>'已连接，但您的 Zinn® 账户需要注意。','Connected to Zinn Digital®.'=>'已连接至 Zinn Digital®。','Connected to Zinn Digital® as %s.'=>'已连接到 Zinn Digital®，用户名为 %s。','Publishing as'=>'发布为','Zinn® site ID'=>'Zinn® 站点 ID','This server could not reach api.zinndigital.com (%s). That is usually a firewall or an outbound-connection rule on your host, not a problem with your Zinn® account — publishing may still be working.'=>'此服务器无法连接到 api.zinndigital.com (%s)。这通常是您的主机上的防火墙或出站连接规则导致的，并非您的 Zinn® 账户有问题——发布功能可能仍在使用中。','Zinn Digital® answered with an error of its own — that is our end, not yours. Publishing is unaffected while this clears.'=>'Zinn Digital® 返回了其自身的错误——这是我们的问题，与您无关。在解决此问题期间，发布功能不受影响。','Your Zinn® account is not currently able to publish to this site. Your dashboard says why.'=>'您的 Zinn® 账户目前无法发布到此网站。您的控制面板中说明了原因。','Zinn Digital® answered HTTP %d, which we do not recognise. Send a diagnostics report from the Support tab and we will look — do not change anything here first.'=>'Zinn Digital® 返回了未识别的 HTTP %d 响应。请从“支持”标签页发送诊断报告，我们会进行查看——在此之前请勿更改任何内容。','Check again now'=>'立即重新检查','Checked. The connection is live.'=>'已检查。连接正常。','We could not remove the application password, so this site is still connected. Delete “Zinn Digital® (publishing)” on your profile screen and try again — we have changed nothing.'=>'无法删除应用程序密码，因此该网站仍处于连接状态。请在您的个人资料页面上删除“Zinn Digital® (publishing)”然后重试——我们未做任何更改。','Disconnected. The application password has been revoked, so Zinn Digital® can no longer publish to this site. Nothing already published was touched.'=>'已断开连接。应用程序密码已被撤销，因此 Zinn Digital® 无法再发布到此网站。所有已发布的内容均未受影响。','That file could not be read from this server, so nothing was uploaded.'=>'无法从此服务器读取该文件，因此未上传任何内容。','This site could not stream the upload, so nothing was sent.'=>'此站点无法流式传输上传内容，因此未发送任何数据。','This file is %1$s and this site\'s PHP has no cURL, so the largest it can upload is %2$s.'=>'此文件大小为 %1$s，且此网站的 PHP 未启用 cURL，因此最大可上传大小为 %2$s。','The upload could not be completed.'=>'无法完成上传。','Storage refused the upload (HTTP %d).'=>'存储拒绝了上传 (HTTP %d)。','Style preset'=>'样式预设','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'一个起点。其下的任何内容都会覆盖它。','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'使用我自己的颜色和尺寸','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'关闭此选项，将完全按原样使用预设。','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'请参阅 Zinn Digital® 发行说明。','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'已下载的更新未能通过完整性检查，因此未进行安装。']];